This Code for the 3 Pillars of the Masterthesis is in seperated into the following folder:

Everything related to the spectroscopy will be found in the Spectroscopy folder.

The Code for the analisis for the 3D-CSI Scans is in the folder csi_spectroscopy.

Everything regarding modeling can be found in the modeling folder. 

Each folder has src folders in which functions that are used frequently are stored. 

